e 5 stars is bc it took over an hour for us to have pizza delivered on a Sunday evening. It was worth the wait! We ordered a normally pepperoni pizza and a 1/2 Jaguar Jambalaya and 1/2 Mustang mushroom. The pepperoni was amazing.. wonderful flavor and the crust is to die for. The Jag Jambalaya is fairly spicy..the combination and sauce were delightful! I loved it my friend did not due to the spice. The Mustang mushroom I didn't care for but my friend loved. I do really like mushrooms but it just wasn't there for me."},{"business_id":"sojdFExw0HlPCcgM_G1n9w","review_id":"7r3WV6LFkphCQ6Ad1gvIJw","date":"2019-08-09T17:07:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9041035175323486,"text_excerpt":"Their Garage Specialty pizza is to die for-especially like the arugula (totally unexpected but really a unique combination). Do not expect immediate delivery, as these are handcrafted to your specifications. Very nice local folks-I'd much rather patronize their establishment vs nationwide chain."},{"business_id":"sojdFExw0HlPCcgM_G1n9w","review_id":"MG1laiPwM_eciCS-wS9ugA","date":"2017-02-13T15:02:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8988957405090332,"text_excerpt":"Very good pizza with good amount of toppings. A bit greasy, but not too much. Hould be a little greasy, right? Really enjoyed it. Also, wasn't too long a time for delivery - 35 min - roughly. Try it, you'll like it!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"sojdFExw0HlPCcgM_G1n9w","photo_id":"et_Yx6jjEvbAe6XI6Rp74Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/et_Yx6jjEvbAe6XI6Rp74Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
